<title>POLAND: Polish Stalprodukt to start bourse trade Aug 6.</title>
<headline>Polish Stalprodukt to start bourse trade Aug 6.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish steel products maker Stalprodukt SA  will start trade on the Warsaw bourse's main market on August 6, bourse  deputy president Ryszard Czerniawski told reporters on Friday.</p>
<p>The company's April initial public offering of 1.2 million shares  at 25 zlotys each was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
